// expect-exit: 0
//
// WHAT THE REBUILD OF LANDING 177c LEAVES LEGAL, AND WHAT IT READS (the second rulings' must-stay-legal lists): each module is one cell, with the value it read alone. A failure exits with the cell's position in
// `main`'s list. `tests/types/rejection/header_ptr_uses.npk`, `wild_into_plain_roads.npk`, `wild_generic_words.npk` and `tests/analysis/rejection/wild_door_roads.npk` are the refusals beside them.
